{
  "name": "Wedding - Guest Sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Guest list from Google Sheets\n\nType guests in the sheet tab **Guests**: only **name**, **guests** (most people they may bring), **pax** (seats) and **table**. Leave **token**, **link** and **status** empty; this workflow fills them.\n\n**Top row, Sync guest sheet:** new rows get a secret token and are created in the **wedding_guests** Data Table; rows that already have a token update name / guests / pax / table. The sheet then shows each guest's personal link and RSVP / check-in status. Safe to run again. Nothing is ever deleted.\n\nBefore running: attach your Google credential to **Read guest sheet** and **Write back to sheet**, pick the spreadsheet in both, and set the site address in **Settings**.\n\n**Bottom row, Reset test guests:** clears RSVP and check-in of the fixed test guests (token starts with 7e57) so you can try RSVP and scanning again. Real guests are never touched.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 380
      },
      "id": "f4d58cb0-ac1d-4f80-bb08-90537c20c550",
      "name": "Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
